{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.206,18.17,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,14.953,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,15.359,1.643,1.471,"India Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.266,1.46,1.307,"15 November 2026"],[13.889,10.995,33.466,3.651,3.268,"Mahindra & Mahindra"],[13.889,14.731,44.043,2.373,2.124,"An incentive in the profit, a discount in the price"],[13.889,20.845,52.951,1.809,1.634,"M&M has risen 13% since its Q2 FY27 results on 5 November (NIFTY: 5%)."],[13.889,22.289,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Consolidated net profit grew 25% to ₹4,588 cr. Two facts sit behind that. On the"],[13.889,23.733,52.934,1.809,1.634,"call the CFO said about ₹1,000 cr of production-linked incentive (PLI) was"],[13.889,25.177,52.931,1.809,1.634,"booked in the quarter: after tax, some 15% of net profit, and more than the"],[13.889,26.621,52.934,1.809,1.634,"electric-SUV segment’s ₹624 cr profit. And core margins fell: SUVs and pickups"],[13.889,28.065,52.988,1.809,1.634,"earned 9.8% (11.0% a year ago), tractors 17.6% (20.6%). Standalone EBITDA"],[13.889,29.509,40.268,1.809,1.634,"before investment income rose 3% in H1 on revenue up 25%."],[13.889,31.995,52.934,1.809,1.634,"1) SUV volumes grow 15% in FY27E (guidance: mid-to-high teens); H2 needs"],[13.889,33.439,52.934,1.809,1.634,"67,000 a month against capacity of 68,000, rising to 82,000 by March. 2)"],[13.889,34.883,52.934,1.809,1.634,"Tractor volumes fall 9% in H2: the monsoon was 87% of normal, October"],[13.889,36.328,52.934,1.809,1.634,"domestic sales fell 13%, and management sees a flat year. 3) Margins recover"],[13.889,37.772,52.961,1.809,1.634,"part of the loss in FY28E as 4-5% price rises meet easing costs. Standalone EPS"],[13.889,39.216,52.964,1.809,1.634,"of ₹138 (FY27E) and ₹159 (FY28E) is 2% and 4% above consensus. 4) The PLI"],[13.889,40.684,52.931,1.809,1.634,"scheme covers sales to FY28. We assume it ends and cost and pricing replace"],[13.889,42.128,40.359,1.809,1.634,"half: consolidated EPS grows 15% a year to FY28E, then 1%."],[13.889,44.59,52.951,1.809,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of ₹3,850 is a sum of parts on earnings 12 months ahead."],[13.889,46.034,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Auto and Farm at 21.5x, the median forward P/E of nine listed Indian vehicle"],[13.889,47.502,52.936,1.809,1.634,"makers, are worth ₹3,226 a share. Tech Mahindra and Mahindra Finance at"],[13.889,48.946,52.951,1.809,1.634,"market value less 20% add ₹497; the smaller businesses, at 18x less 20%, ₹123."],[13.889,50.39,52.934,1.809,1.634,"Net cash of ₹44,685 cr is not added: its income is inside segment profit. If PLI is"],[13.889,51.834,52.936,1.809,1.634,"extended the target is ₹4,240; if it ends with nothing replaced, ₹3,560. Even that"],[13.889,53.278,52.966,1.809,1.634,"is above the price, which values Auto and Farm at 18x. Consensus target:"],[13.889,54.722,52.931,1.809,1.634,"₹3,977. Downside: a second weak monsoon; capex (H1: ₹7,365 cr, ₹3,957 cr a"],[13.889,56.167,23.601,1.809,1.634,"year ago) running ahead of demand."],[13.889,58.654,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[14.451,67.265,2.306,1.022,0.915,"2,750"],[14.451,65.851,2.306,1.022,0.915,"3,000"],[14.451,64.436,2.306,1.022,0.915,"3,250"],[14.451,63.022,2.306,1.022,0.915,"3,500"],[14.451,61.607,2.306,1.022,0.915,"3,750"],[14.451,60.195,2.306,1.022,0.915,"4,000"],[18.306,67.96,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Jan 26"],[22.929,67.96,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Apr 26"],[27.701,67.96,2.47,1.022,0.915,"Jul 26"],[32.473,67.96,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[18.913,69.131,2.693,1.275,1.111,"M&M ("],[21.609,69.157,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[22.222,69.131,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[25.306,69.131,7.901,1.275,1.111,"NIFTY 50 (rebased)"],[20.303,70.291,1.972,1.387,1.209,"YTD"],[25.535,70.291,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[30.266,70.291,1.433,1.387,1.209,"3m"],[34.446,70.291,1.984,1.387,1.209,"12m"],[15.277,71.356,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[19.353,71.356,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−9.2%"],[24.065,71.356,2.811,1.387,1.209,"16.4%"],[28.765,71.356,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−2.8%"],[33